{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ferret Frenzy</i> is a free compilation of four minigames with three variants each, originally created for Pirate Software's January 2024 Game Jam.\u00a0\u00a0 Access the variants by going to Level Select or in the settings menu, changing the Variant Dropdown, and then clicking Play on the main menu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires a mouse for some minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184590/extras/ee25408c765bcba1f2eafbd5929beba4.poster.avif?t=1760552008\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184590/extras/ee25408c765bcba1f2eafbd5929beba4.webm?t=1760552008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184590/extras/ee25408c765bcba1f2eafbd5929beba4.mp4?t=1760552008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Wrangler:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as Thor and try to wrangle some ferrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catch as many as possible within the time limit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i